freeVars[term_]:=Switch[term[[1]],"var",{term[[2]]},"lam",Complement[freeVars[term[[4]]],{term[[2]]}],"exists",Complement[freeVars[term[[3]]],{term[[2]]}],_,Union[freeVars[term[[2]]],freeVars[term[[3]]]]];
substitute[term_,name_,value_]:=Module[{tag=term[[1]],binder},If[!MemberQ[freeVars[term],name],Return[term]];If[tag=="var",Return[value]];If[MemberQ[{"lam","exists"},tag],binder=term[[2]];If[MemberQ[freeVars[value],binder],Return[$Failed]];If[tag=="lam",Return[lm[binder,term[[3]],substitute[term[[4]],name,value]]],Return[ex[binder,substitute[term[[3]],name,value]]]]];{tag,substitute[term[[2]],name,value],substitute[term[[3]],name,value]}];
typeOf[term_,env_]:=Module[{tag=term[[1]],left,right},Switch[tag,"var",Return[Lookup[env,term[[2]]]],"lam",Return[ar[term[[3]],typeOf[term[[4]],Join[env,<|term[[2]]->term[[3]]|>]]]],"exists",Return[If[typeOf[term[[3]],Join[env,<|term[[2]]->"E"|>]]=="Prop","Prop",$Failed]]];left=typeOf[term[[2]],env];right=typeOf[term[[3]],env];If[tag=="and",Return[If[left===right==="Prop","Prop",$Failed]]];If[ListQ[left]&&left[[1]]=="arrow"&&left[[2]]===right,left[[3]],$Failed]];
